  <running_head>De Fide Salvifica</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>Est</catchword>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">Et hoc modo vocati Electi, constituunt</l>
    <l n="2">invisibilem illam Ecclesiam Catholicā,</l>
    <l n="3">quae est communio Sanctorum: quam</l>
    <l n="4">in Symbolo Fidei nostrae credere nos profitem-</l>
    <l n="5">ur. Matt.8.v.11. Joh.10.v.16. Gal.4.v.26.</l>
    <l n="6" para="true">Fides salvifica, est medium electorum</l>
    <l n="7">proprium, quo homo electus beneficium re-</l>
    <l n="8">demptionis etiam ad se peculiariter pertinere</l>
    <l n="9">certo statuit, sibique privatim meritum &amp;</l>
    <l n="10">justitiam Christi Mediatoris applicat.</l>
    <l n="11">Marc.16.v.16. Rom.10.v.9.10. Ephes.2.v.8.</l>
    <l n="12">Tit.1.v.1.2. Heb.10.v.22. &amp; 11.v.1.</l>
    <l n="13" para="true">Partes illius sunt: notitia de Christo, &amp;</l>
    <l n="14">in eum fiducia.</l>
    <l n="15" para="true">Notitia, quā intelligit doctrinam de</l>
    <l n="16">Christo redemtore, eamque veram esse agnoscit.</l>
    <l n="17">1 Cor.2.v.2. 2 Cor.4.v.14.</l>
    <l n="18" para="true">Fiducia, quā Christum agnitum cum</l>
    <l n="19">omnibus ipsius beneficiis apprehendit, ac</l>
    <l n="20">tota in eum recumbit. Rom.4.v.18.&amp;8.v.</l>
    <l n="21">38.39.</l>
    <l n="22">2 Cor.3.v.4. Col.2.v.2.</l>
    <l n="23" para="true">Justificatio porrhò, est medium electio-</l>
    <l n="24">nis, quo Deus vocatos credentes, ex mera</l>
    <l n="25">gratia, propter Christi meritum, à peccatis</l>
    <l n="26">absolvit, acjustos pronunciat. Roman.3.v.</l>
    <l n="27">24.seqq.&amp;5.v.1. Gal.2.v.16. Eph.2.v.8.</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes />
